<title>MEXICO: Protexa invests $2 mln in new Mexican plant.</title>
<headline>Protexa invests $2 mln in new Mexican plant.</headline>
<dateline>MONTERREY, Mexico 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grupo Protexa has invested $2 million in a new anti-corrosive paint plant in the state of Mexico, the company announced on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The intial investment was $2 million, including real estate and machinery,&quot; the company said.</p>
<p>Protexa said it expected production at its new plant to reach 1,000 tonnes, generating $1 million a month in revenues.</p>
<p>-- Debora Montesinos, Monterrey newsroom +528 342-9475</p>
</text>
